  "name": "First Principles Review",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Claude Code skill that reviews codebases top-down: WHY (goal) → WHAT (architecture) → HOW (implementation) → improvements ranked by leverage. The antidote to surface-level LLM nitpick reviews.",
